    "statement": "Two shell halves split on the plane perpendicular to the chain axis. The chassis is built outside the shell, each half is slid over its pole cartridge with its pole bearing, and the halves are joined at the equatorial rim by screws. No assembly tooling or fixture has been designed; the screw count and rim geometry are undefined."
